# the damage: the library top, Snapcaster Mage and Lightning Bolt, are Bot1's. The Mage goes onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 and the
# Bolt into Bot1's graveyard next to the Beastie; Bot2's library and graveyard are untouched by it.

